  "articleBody": "Before a contractor installs a kitchen peninsula, confirm its size, purpose, aisle clearances, cabinet configuration, countertop overhang, appliance locations, and any electrical or plumbing changes. Gather measurements, appliance specifications, preferred materials, and photos of existing conditions so the design and construction team can identify conflicts before work begins.",
